Percent-encode, decode and take URLs apart (RFC 3986, WHATWG)

Usage: tw url <COMMAND>

Commands:
  encode  Percent-encode text for a URL
  decode  Decode percent-encoded text
  parse   Take a URL apart: scheme, user, host, port, path, query parameters, fragment
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
